I visit Tatsuya Jam.
It won a top 5 prize of the world tonament called Dalemain Marmalade Awards 2016.
The shop has a lovely cat’s signboard.

Unfortunately, yuzu marmalade jam which won the prize are sold out in this season,
so I bought a amanatsu(which tastes like orange) marmalade jam.
All jam are very cute packages, and have enough time by the expiration date.
Then they are the best for gifts.

